{
  "mark.8.p1.b1": {
    "text": "In those days the crowd once again became very large, and they had nothing to eat.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:1"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p1.b2": {
    "text": "I have compassion for this crowd, because they have already been with Me three days and have nothing to eat.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p1.b3": {
    "text": "If I send them home hungry, they will faint along the way. For some of them have come a great distance.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p2.b1": {
    "text": "Where in this desolate place could anyone find enough bread to feed all these people?",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p2.b2": {
    "text": "How many loaves do you have?",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p2.b3": {
    "text": "Seven,",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p3.b1": {
    "text": "And He instructed the crowd to sit down on the ground.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p3.b2": {
    "text": "Then He took the seven loaves, gave thanks and broke them, and gave them to His disciples",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p3.b3": {
    "text": "They also had a few small fish, and Jesus blessed them and ordered that these be set before them as well.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p4.b1": {
    "text": "The people ate and were satisfied,",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p4.b2": {
    "text": "And the disciples picked up seven basketfuls of broken pieces that were left over.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p4.b3": {
    "text": "And about four thousand men were present.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:9"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p4.b4": {
    "text": "He got into the boat with His disciples and went to the district of Dalmanutha.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:10"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p5.b1": {
    "text": "Then the Pharisees came and began to argue with Jesus, testing Him by demanding from Him a sign from heaven.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p5.b2": {
    "text": "Why does this generation demand a sign?",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p5.b3": {
    "text": "Truly I tell you, no sign will be given to this generation.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p5.b4": {
    "text": "And He left them, got back into the boat, and crossed to the other side.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p6.b1": {
    "text": "Now the disciples had forgotten to take bread, except for one loaf they had with them in the boat.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:14"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p6.b2": {
    "text": "Watch out! … Beware of the leaven of the Pharisees and of Herod.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p6.b3": {
    "text": "So they began to discuss with one another the fact that they had no bread.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:16"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p7.b1": {
    "text": "Why are you debating about having no bread?",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:17"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p7.b2": {
    "text": "Do you still not see or understand? Do you have such hard hearts?",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:17"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p7.b3": {
    "text": "Having eyes, do you not see? And having ears, do you not hear?",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p7.b4": {
    "text": "And do you not remember?",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p8.b1": {
    "text": "When I broke the five loaves for the five thousand, how many basketfuls of broken pieces did you collect?",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p8.b2": {
    "text": "Twelve,",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p8.b3": {
    "text": "Seven,",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:20"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p8.b4": {
    "text": "Do you still not understand?",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p9.b1": {
    "text": "When they arrived at Bethsaida,",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p9.b2": {
    "text": "Some people brought a blind man and begged Jesus to touch him.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p9.b3": {
    "text": "So He took the blind man by the hand and led him out of the village.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:23"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p9.b4": {
    "text": "Can you see anything?",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:23"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p10.b1": {
    "text": "I can see the people,",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:24"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p10.b2": {
    "text": "But they look like trees walking around.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:24"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p11.b1": {
    "text": "Once again Jesus placed His hands on the man’s eyes,",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:25"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p11.b2": {
    "text": "And when he opened them his sight was restored, and he could see everything clearly.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:25"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p11.b3": {
    "text": "Do not go back into the village.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p12.b1": {
    "text": "Then Jesus and His disciples went on to the villages around Caesarea Philippi.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p12.b2": {
    "text": "Who do people say I am?",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p12.b3": {
    "text": "Some say John the Baptist;",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:28"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p12.b4": {
    "text": "Others say Elijah; and still others, one of the prophets.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:28"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p13.b1": {
    "text": "But what about you? … Who do you say I am?",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:29"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p13.b2": {
    "text": "You are the Christ.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:29"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p13.b3": {
    "text": "And Jesus warned them not to tell anyone about Him.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:30"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p14.b1": {
    "text": "Then He began to teach them",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p14.b2": {
    "text": "That the Son of Man must suffer many things",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p14.b3": {
    "text": "And be rejected by the elders, chief priests, and scribes, and that He must be killed",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p14.b4": {
    "text": "And after three days rise again.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p15.b1": {
    "text": "He spoke this message quite frankly, and Peter took Him aside and began to rebuke Him.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:32"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p15.b2": {
    "text": "Get behind Me, Satan!",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:33"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p15.b3": {
    "text": "For you do not have in mind the things of God, but the things of men.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:33"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p16.b1": {
    "text": "Then Jesus called the crowd to Him along with His disciples, and He told them,",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p16.b2": {
    "text": "If anyone wants to come after Me,",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p16.b3": {
    "text": "He must deny himself",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p16.b4": {
    "text": "And take up his cross and follow Me.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p17.b1": {
    "text": "For whoever wants to save his life will lose it,",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:35"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p17.b2": {
    "text": "But whoever loses his life for My sake and for the gospel will save it.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:35"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p17.b3": {
    "text": "What does it profit a man to gain the whole world, yet forfeit his soul?",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:36"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p17.b4": {
    "text": "Or what can a man give in exchange for his soul?",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:37"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p18.b1": {
    "text": "If anyone is ashamed of Me and My words in this adulterous and sinful generation,",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:38"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p18.b2": {
    "text": "When He comes in His Father’s glory with the holy angels.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:38"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.8.p18.b3": {
    "text": "The Son of Man will also be ashamed of him",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 8:38"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  }
}
